      "name": "Credit exposure",
      "kind": "concept",
      "aliases": [
        "amount at risk"
      ],
      "definition": "The amount at risk to an obligor or counterparty. Ambiguous on its own: it may mean notional, drawn balance, exposure at default, or an amount net of collateral and guarantees. A caller must resolve which before computing.",
