      "kind": "default_definition",
      "aliases": [
        "utp",
        "unlikely to pay"
      ],
      "definition": "A qualitative default trigger: the obligor is judged unlikely to pay in full without recourse to actions such as realizing collateral. Judgement-based, so two institutions can classify the same obligor differently.",
